# name|config|expected ("pass", or "fail <Property>" for a known finding)
teardown|teardown.cfg|pass
no-wait|no-wait.cfg|pass
# Why the design needs the lock: without it the close and a create race
# at READ COMMITTED, even in one transaction each.
no-lock|no-lock.cfg|fail NoWorkspaceAfterClose
# ...and without --wait as well, the workspace's volume outlives the cluster.
no-lock-no-wait|no-lock-no-wait.cfg|fail NothingOrphaned
